@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 正式注册，模拟一个已知设备
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: TongfengManualBrowser/1.0
X-Device-Fingerprint: manual-device-a
X-Device-Label: Web / Chrome / Windows
X-Forwarded-For: 10.10.1.8

{
  "nickname": "v23-risk-user",
  "accountType": "EMAIL",
  "account": "v23-risk-user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123",
  "consent": {
    "consentVersion": "v1.0",
    "privacyPolicyVersion": "privacy-v1.0",
    "privacyAccepted": true,
    "termsAccepted": true,
    "medicalDataAuthorized": true,
    "familyCollaborationAuthorized": true,
    "notificationAuthorized": true
  }
}

### 2. 请求找回密码验证码，观察 deliveryProvider / deliveryStatus
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verification-codes/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "PASSWORD_RESET",
  "accountType": "EMAIL",
  "account": "v23-risk-user@example.com"
}

> {%
client.global.set("reset_code", response.body.data.simulatedCode);
%}

### 3. 立即再次请求，预期命中 cooldown
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verification-codes/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "PASSWORD_RESET",
  "accountType": "EMAIL",
  "account": "v23-risk-user@example.com"
}

### 4. 使用新设备、新网络登录，预期 loginRiskLevel=RED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: TongfengManualBrowser/2.0
X-Device-Fingerprint: manual-device-b
X-Device-Label: Web / Firefox / Linux
X-Forwarded-For: 172.20.8.15

{
  "accountType": "EMAIL",
  "account": "v23-risk-user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 5. 查看当前会话，确认设备标签和风险等级
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 查看提醒列表，预期出现 ACCOUNT_SECURITY
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
